s=10)`\n- Force a locked door: `kick(direction=...)`\n- Melee: `attack(direction=N|...)` — never on a `[PET`-tagged monster\n- Ranged: `throw(item=..., direction=...)`\n- Eat before Weak: `eat(item=...)`\n- Drink: `quaff(item=...)`\n- Read: `read(item=...)`\n- Scare monsters off: `engrave_elbereth`\n- Last resort (once per ~1000 turns): `pray`\n- Notes: `add_note`\n- Recall a note: `recall(query=...)`\n- Re-pin your goal: `pin_objective`\n- Wiki: `wiki_lookup(page=\"kobold\")`\n- Wiki search: `wiki_search(query=\"cockatrice\")`\n\nYour top-level goal is pre-pinned as `Objective:` in JOURNAL."
