        "role": "user",
        "content": "[Pathing to (43,5): 1 steps.]\n\n=== JOURNAL ===\nObjective: Descend as deep as possible, survive, and retrieve the Amulet of Yendor.\n\n=== MAP ===\n\n\n                                  --------------\n                                  |........d...|\n  ---------------                #.............|\n  |.............|#             ###---------@----\n  |<............|#             #           #\n  |.............|#           ###          ##\n  |.............|#           #            #\n  |.............|##########  #            #\n  -----------.--- ### ----|-##            #     ##########\n             ###### # |....-#####################\n                    ##+....|#             `\n                      |....|#\n                      |....|#\n                      |.....#\n                      |....|\n                      ------\n\n\n\n\n\n\n=== STATUS ===\nHP: 16/16  AC: 6  Dlvl: 1  Turn: 276  XP: 1  $: 11  Pos: (43,5)\nCharacter: valkyrie (human, neutral)\n\n=== INVENTORY ===\n  $: 11 gold pieces\n  b: a +1 long sword (weapon in hand)\n  c: a +0 dagger (alternate weapon; not wielded)\n  d: an uncursed +3 small shield (being worn)\n  e: an uncursed food ration\n  f: an orcish dagger\n  g: a studded leather armor\n\n=== ADJACENT === N=. NE=. E=- SE=  S=# SW=  W=- NW=.\n\n=== HINT === No `>` visible. Nearest way out is an open doorway at (34,4) — `move_to(x=34, y=4)`. (6 exits visible.)\n\n=== VISIBLE FEATURES === stairs UP at (3,6); door (open/gap) at (34,4), (13,10), (26,10) +2 more; door (closed) at (22,12)\n\n=== VISIBLE MONSTERS === little dog at (43,3), 2 steps N [PET - don't attack]\n\n=== MESSAGES ===\n  As you kick the door, it crashes open!\n"
      },
